# Crystal Imperium play test: fast Egg hatching (DECISIONS.md D32). An Egg cycle passes every 8
# steps instead of Heart & Soul's 256, so a Togepi Egg (10 cycles) hatches after 11 cycles,
# about 90 steps (97 here, from the warp), where Heart & Soul needs over 2,800: on the 0.8.0 ROM
# this walk doesn't hatch it. The walk is 7 laps of 18 steps across New Bark Town (no grass, so
# no wild battles); the hatching stops it ("Huh?", then the hatching scene).
# Byte 19 of a party Pokemon holds hasSpecies (bit 1) and isEgg (bit 2): 6 for an Egg, 2 after.
!new_game()
!give_mon(155, 5)
!give_egg(175)
expect8 {gPlayerPartyCount} 2 egg_in_party
expect8 {gPlayerParty+119} 6 second_slot_is_an_egg
!warp(0, 0, 1)
!walkto(10, 12, order="yx")
!pace(19, 10, 12, 7, soft=True)
shot 01_huh.png
waituntil32 {gMain+4} {CB2_EggHatch+1} 600 A egg_hatches_within_126_steps
wait 600
shot 02_hatching.png
# Decline the nickname (B), then back in the field
mash B 900
wait 200
expect32 {gMain+4} {CB2_Overworld+1} back_in_the_field
expect8 {gPlayerPartyCount} 2 party_after_hatching
expect8 {gPlayerParty+119} 2 egg_hatched
